{"ts":"2026-08-16T02:41:42.317Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"e05f9eb4c601ff7ec7f5cf31","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-web-yqmi"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"The package catalog could silently omit a fleet package, and had already drifted from pm-ops capabilities"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The catalog is the single source of truth for what the UI can install, and its tests asserted only one direction: every catalog entry has a real fleet manifest. Nothing asserted the converse, so a package added to the fleet was invisible to the UI with every test green. Three were: pm-vcs and pm-rl ship a manifest.json declaring capabilities and were absent entirely. The one-directional check had also let a real drift through unnoticed: pm-ops declared a services capability its catalog entry did not carry."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:41:42.317Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:41:42.317Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A fleet package that ships a manifest.json declaring capabilities and is absent from the catalog fails the suite; a catalog entry that claims to be published while its package.json declares no publishConfig.access fails; a catalog entry whose capabilities differ from its manifest fails; and the expected membership is derived from the fleet rather than restated as a second hardcoded list"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"41452e98e34bc01d843b7aaeee95368061a28b7db5b9fc2886c5d4d064f259ce","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
