{"ts":"2026-08-16T02:44:10.323Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"e05f9eb4c601ff7ec7f5cf31","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:44:10.323Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T02:44:10.322Z","author":"claude-code","text":"Revert-proof run against this exact tree. Baseline exit 0. Deleting the pm-vcs catalog entry while the fleet still contains it exits 1. Declaring pm-vcs published when its package.json carries no publishConfig.access exits 1. Declaring pm-graph unreleased when it does carry one exits 1. Drifting pm-ops capabilities from its manifest exits 1. Restored exit 0. The pm-ops case was not hypothetical: pm-ops had already added a services capability its catalog entry did not carry, and the one-directional test in place before this change did not notice."}]}],"before_hash":"8d422eb661cbe794fa1ce91dc180c8fc12f066e286364831670bf29d354a69fe","after_hash":"a7903e77e7ee42e0a8fdc1cbe21e35be71523a84ef924a00f9d838f84eaa60ec","item_hash_version":2,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
{"ts":"2026-08-16T02:44:11.544Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"e05f9eb4c601ff7ec7f5cf31","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"close","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:44:11.544Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"closed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/closed_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:44:11.518Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/completed_at","value":"2026-08-16T02:44:11.518Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"The catalog now represents every pm extension in the fleet. Membership is derived from the fleet directory rather than restated as a second list, availability is checked against each package's own publishConfig.access, and the pm-ops capability drift the previous test missed is corrected. pm-vcs and pm-rl are listed as unreleased and resolveNpmSpec refuses them, so the UI can show them honestly without offering an install that cannot work."}],"before_hash":"a7903e77e7ee42e0a8fdc1cbe21e35be71523a84ef924a00f9d838f84eaa60ec","after_hash":"c4f4e9e63910e95ee1696903c0f5ae6a0b3e20872ca5f7774380333f90b52cc3","item_hash_version":2,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
